(6571000, 979201, 17837, '<td valign="top">This image would benefit greatly from open water. As it is, I feel as if the dead reed or whatever it is in the water distracts from the real beauty, which is the foliage and the reflections.</td>', 'This image would benefit greatly from open water. As it is, I feel as if the dead reed or whatever it is in the water distracts from the real beauty, which is the foliage and the reflections.', '2011-10-18 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571002, 979111, 17837, '<td valign="top">While I don''t think that the body of water is the main focus here, the shot could benefit from a closer crop. All the open space around the two birds isn''t really helping the image imo. Also, it looks like it may be a bit out of focus.</td>', 'While I don''t think that the body of water is the main focus here, the shot could benefit from a closer crop. All the open space around the two birds isn''t really helping the image imo. Also, it looks like it may be a bit out of focus.', '2011-10-18 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571011, 979160, 17837, '<td valign="top">I feel as if there is no definitive subject in this photo. The tree(s) area is too dark, and the water is very very bright and reflective. I think that the portrait crop is also deterring from the subject as well.</td>', 'I feel as if there is no definitive subject in this photo. The tree(s) area is too dark, and the water is very very bright and reflective. I think that the portrait crop is also deterring from the subject as well.', '2011-10-18 22:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571012, 979022, 17837, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, but what is it leading to I keep asking myself. I feel like there is no definitive subject here. Great execution, I love the tones.</td>', 'Great leading lines, but what is it leading to I keep asking myself. I feel like there is no definitive subject here. Great execution, I love the tones.', '2011-10-18 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571013, 979143, 17837, '<td valign="top">A technically sound photograph, however I feel as if the boat is ready to drown itself in the water. I think if you were to put the boat and water at the bottom third of the photo, it would be much better.</td>', 'A technically sound photograph, however I feel as if the boat is ready to drown itself in the water. I think if you were to put the boat and water at the bottom third of the photo, it would be much better.', '2011-10-18 22:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571014, 978912, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the crash of the waves, however the photo seems a bit underexposed. I understand the complexity of getting a proper exposure on everything plus the water, so I feel for you.</td>', 'I like the crash of the waves, however the photo seems a bit underexposed. I understand the complexity of getting a proper exposure on everything plus the water, so I feel for you.', '2011-10-18 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571016, 979144, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the clouds, love the reflections. The tones are nice, I think this would look cool in B/W, maybe give it a try for outtakes =)</td>', 'Love the clouds, love the reflections. The tones are nice, I think this would look cool in B/W, maybe give it a try for outtakes =)', '2011-10-18 22:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
