(6571034, 979146, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, the crop is nice, the curves and reflections. Only thing distracting me is the frame, remove that and you get a 9 from me.</td>', 'Love the colors, the crop is nice, the curves and reflections. Only thing distracting me is the frame, remove that and you get a 9 from me.', '2011-10-18 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571036, 979162, 17837, '<td valign="top">good colors, though the reed in front is leading my eye away from the best part of the photo which is the reflections.</td>', 'good colors, though the reed in front is leading my eye away from the best part of the photo which is the reflections.', '2011-10-18 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571037, 978899, 17837, '<td valign="top">a great shot, I wish the sun were a bit better exposed, but that''d be kinda hard =)</td>', 'a great shot, I wish the sun were a bit better exposed, but that''d be kinda hard =)', '2011-10-18 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571248, 979173, 18367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  <br/> <br/>One would almost expect elves or some other mystical creature to suddenly appear from behind the trees. I have no idea as to how you managed to capture this haze, but it does add immensely to the overall character of the image.  <br/> <br/>Very nicely done and the very best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.   One would almost expect elves or some other mystical creature to suddenly appear from behind the trees. I have no idea as to how you managed to capture this haze, but it does add immensely to the overall character of the image.   Very nicely done and the very best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2011-10-19 03:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571254, 978565, 18367, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I must make a point of visiting that part of N.H next fall and see if I can come close to replicating this truly beautiful image.  <br/> <br/>Good luck to you in the challenge.  If all the scores are like mine, I will see this image on the front page when this is over.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I must make a point of visiting that part of N.H next fall and see if I can come close to replicating this truly beautiful image.   Good luck to you in the challenge.  If all the scores are like mine, I will see this image on the front page when this is over.', '2011-10-19 03:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571297, 979034, 139605, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot! You can really feel the scene. Good job.</td>', 'I like this a lot! You can really feel the scene. Good job.', '2011-10-19 04:49:09.000000', NULL, 1);
