(6571687, 979159, 73942, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and depth here.  And this is a different POV of than I''m used to seeing, which is refreshing.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Nice colors and depth here.  And this is a different POV of than I''m used to seeing, which is refreshing.  Good Luck!', '2011-10-19 13:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571834, 978775, 135326, '<td valign="top">A nice treatment here with the fish-eye lens. But IMHO not for this challenge, a set-subject (water etc.) should have the water as the main object in the image, not the sand or sky. I would have rated this much higher in an open subject challenge.<br/>Ron</td>', 'A nice treatment here with the fish-eye lens. But IMHO not for this challenge, a set-subject (water etc.) should have the water as the main object in the image, not the sand or sky. I would have rated this much higher in an open subject challenge.Ron', '2011-10-19 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6571836, 979106, 135326, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this great, pity the sky was so cloudless, just a couple of cloude and their reflection would have put the icing on the cake.<br/>Ron</td>', 'Isn''t this great, pity the sky was so cloudless, just a couple of cloude and their reflection would have put the icing on the cake.Ron', '2011-10-19 17:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
