(6572541, 978853, 96664, '<td valign="top">Although this has water in it I feel like the challenge was more based on the water being the main subject. If it were a free studies I think I would like it more.</td>', 'Although this has water in it I feel like the challenge was more based on the water being the main subject. If it were a free studies I think I would like it more.', '2011-10-20 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572544, 978967, 96664, '<td valign="top">Only one thing I don''t like about this... That is the lime green stripe on the frame. I think an orange colored stripe would have worked better (same color as the rock on the top left of the photo). Other than the stripe though this is freaking awesome!</td>', 'Only one thing I don''t like about this... That is the lime green stripe on the frame. I think an orange colored stripe would have worked better (same color as the rock on the top left of the photo). Other than the stripe though this is freaking awesome!', '2011-10-20 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572545, 978912, 96664, '<td valign="top">Stopped motion alright but there isn''t anything in the foreground that my eye can focus on. Maybe if you went to the other side of that rock formation in the distance and shot from there it would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'Stopped motion alright but there isn''t anything in the foreground that my eye can focus on. Maybe if you went to the other side of that rock formation in the distance and shot from there it would have been more dramatic.', '2011-10-20 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572546, 978970, 96664, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit flat. I wonder what it would have looked like if you were level with the ground. Maybe put the camera low and shot something in the foreground to have a place for my eye to focus on.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit flat. I wonder what it would have looked like if you were level with the ground. Maybe put the camera low and shot something in the foreground to have a place for my eye to focus on.', '2011-10-20 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572547, 979083, 96664, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this one but there is a bit if an issue in my opinion. I love the sun but that seems to be the main subject whereas the water is but a minor detail in the photo. I am not saying that this does not meet the challenge but I just feel like the water should have been more of the subject rather than just a minor detail.</td>', 'I REALLY like this one but there is a bit if an issue in my opinion. I love the sun but that seems to be the main subject whereas the water is but a minor detail in the photo. I am not saying that this does not meet the challenge but I just feel like the water should have been more of the subject rather than just a minor detail.', '2011-10-20 16:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572548, 979022, 96664, '<td valign="top">Love the tones but I feel this will not do well for the reason that the crop you chose does not really fit the photo. More foreground! I want to see more water... Make my eyes follow the water more.</td>', 'Love the tones but I feel this will not do well for the reason that the crop you chose does not really fit the photo. More foreground! I want to see more water... Make my eyes follow the water more.', '2011-10-20 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572551, 978866, 96664, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what to think of this. I think the photo is a bit on the bright side. I wonder if you had an ND filter on it would have helped. I like the waterfall is made the main subject by the surrounding things like the tree on the left and the "V" shapped valley on the top.</td>', 'Not entirely sure what to think of this. I think the photo is a bit on the bright side. I wonder if you had an ND filter on it would have helped. I like the waterfall is made the main subject by the surrounding things like the tree on the left and the "V" shapped valley on the top.', '2011-10-20 16:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572552, 979161, 96664, '<td valign="top">Looks like a place I would love to go to. I think a bit more contrast would have made this pop a little more. I like the frame though. :)</td>', 'Looks like a place I would love to go to. I think a bit more contrast would have made this pop a little more. I like the frame though. :)', '2011-10-20 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572553, 979044, 96664, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! I love the reflection on here too. I think though that I would have liked to have seen the sky more than the water. Basically what I mean by that is to move the skyline to the lower "third" rather than having it on the upper "third."</td>', 'Nice colors! I love the reflection on here too. I think though that I would have liked to have seen the sky more than the water. Basically what I mean by that is to move the skyline to the lower "third" rather than having it on the upper "third."', '2011-10-20 16:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572555, 978886, 96664, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this! Interesting to see that different layers of falls. Although I love the photo I think that the waterfall could have been more dramatic if either zoomed in to get rid of some things on top and bottom or put in a "third" and have more of either the water on the bottom or the trees on top.</td>', 'I love the colors in this! Interesting to see that different layers of falls. Although I love the photo I think that the waterfall could have been more dramatic if either zoomed in to get rid of some things on top and bottom or put in a "third" and have more of either the water on the bottom or the trees on top.', '2011-10-20 16:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572557, 978915, 96664, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the crop of this one. More water please. I think having the people walking into the frame is good but I would have liked to have seen more water on the right.</td>', 'Not sure I like the crop of this one. More water please. I think having the people walking into the frame is good but I would have liked to have seen more water on the right.', '2011-10-20 16:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572558, 979081, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like it. If I had to change anything I would probably crop a touch from the top. Other than that I love the photo.</td>', 'I like it. If I had to change anything I would probably crop a touch from the top. Other than that I love the photo.', '2011-10-20 16:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572559, 979106, 96664, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes! The reflection on this is perfect. If you had flipped this over I don''t think anyone would have been able to tell. The rock on the left''s reflection seems just as sharp as the rock itself!! I like this one.</td>', 'Holy smokes! The reflection on this is perfect. If you had flipped this over I don''t think anyone would have been able to tell. The rock on the left''s reflection seems just as sharp as the rock itself!! I like this one.', '2011-10-20 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572560, 978491, 96664, '<td valign="top">Only thing I think would drop a scorers vote is that the photo seems a bit soft. The colors are perfect but I think that the trees aren''t in that "perfect" focus people look for.</td>', 'Only thing I think would drop a scorers vote is that the photo seems a bit soft. The colors are perfect but I think that the trees aren''t in that "perfect" focus people look for.', '2011-10-20 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572561, 978925, 96664, '<td valign="top">Too dark in my opinion. I would have also put the building into a "third" rather than smack dab in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Too dark in my opinion. I would have also put the building into a "third" rather than smack dab in the middle of the frame.', '2011-10-20 16:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572562, 978751, 96664, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. Being advanced editing you aren''t aloud but I would have taken out the picnic table and pavilion. That being said, the water in this is awesome. Well done using the long shutter to make the lines around the turn.</td>', 'This is really cool. Being advanced editing you aren''t aloud but I would have taken out the picnic table and pavilion. That being said, the water in this is awesome. Well done using the long shutter to make the lines around the turn.', '2011-10-20 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572564, 979196, 96664, '<td valign="top">I feel like this was once a water filled river or lake. That being said you are probably getting slammed with DNMC comments. Just from what I have heard I am going to guess that this is in Texas.</td>', 'I feel like this was once a water filled river or lake. That being said you are probably getting slammed with DNMC comments. Just from what I have heard I am going to guess that this is in Texas.', '2011-10-20 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572565, 978980, 96664, '<td valign="top">Talk about an interesting perspective. I got to this photo and turned my whole head! Lol. I like it and to be honest if it wasn''t for that little bit of ripple on the top right I wouldn''t be able to tell which side was up and which was down. Well done.</td>', 'Talk about an interesting perspective. I got to this photo and turned my whole head! Lol. I like it and to be honest if it wasn''t for that little bit of ripple on the top right I wouldn''t be able to tell which side was up and which was down. Well done.', '2011-10-20 16:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572566, 978955, 96664, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a wider angle of this. Other than that I think that this photo is okay. Nothing spectacular but not bad for sure.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a wider angle of this. Other than that I think that this photo is okay. Nothing spectacular but not bad for sure.', '2011-10-20 16:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572567, 979040, 96664, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this does not have a "wow" factor to it. The water is blurred nicely and the framing of the waterfall is nice but I think the colors are a bit flat.</td>', 'Unfortunately this does not have a "wow" factor to it. The water is blurred nicely and the framing of the waterfall is nice but I think the colors are a bit flat.', '2011-10-20 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
