(6572569, 979193, 96664, '<td valign="top">Looks like a rock more than water. Abstract indeed. I kinda like it even though I think the voters won''t like it so much.</td>', 'Looks like a rock more than water. Abstract indeed. I kinda like it even though I think the voters won''t like it so much.', '2011-10-20 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572570, 979146, 96664, '<td valign="top">A touch of crop from the right side to get rid of the bank would have made this one of my favorites in the challenge. The clouds are awesome!</td>', 'A touch of crop from the right side to get rid of the bank would have made this one of my favorites in the challenge. The clouds are awesome!', '2011-10-20 16:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572571, 979198, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like it. Even though it doesn''t have that "wow" factor from the lack of color i still find it soothing to look at.</td>', 'I like it. Even though it doesn''t have that "wow" factor from the lack of color i still find it soothing to look at.', '2011-10-20 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
