(6572573, 978797, 96664, '<td valign="top">HDR is called for this. The left side is too dark for the right side. The windmill is standoff(ish) enough to be the subject even if the photo is vibrant and colorful.</td>', 'HDR is called for this. The left side is too dark for the right side. The windmill is standoff(ish) enough to be the subject even if the photo is vibrant and colorful.', '2011-10-20 16:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
