(6572699, 978913, 96664, '<td valign="top">I feel as if this photo was overly processed. I think that the trees in the background  are sort of unnatural looking. I like though that you framed the photo on three sides (top branch, side branch, and sand on the beach).</td>', 'I feel as if this photo was overly processed. I think that the trees in the background  are sort of unnatural looking. I like though that you framed the photo on three sides (top branch, side branch, and sand on the beach).', '2011-10-20 19:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572701, 978750, 96664, '<td valign="top">I love this one. My only issue with this is the frame. The blue to me does not work well with this. I think just a solid black frame would have done the job nicely. I love the colors in the trees! And the water is really inviting for a bit of a swim. :)</td>', 'I love this one. My only issue with this is the frame. The blue to me does not work well with this. I think just a solid black frame would have done the job nicely. I love the colors in the trees! And the water is really inviting for a bit of a swim. :)', '2011-10-20 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572703, 979156, 96664, '<td valign="top">Seems like there is a bit of a halo around the tall buildings. Other than that though I like the stars created by the lights. And I like the fact that the water is a major subject. Well done.</td>', 'Seems like there is a bit of a halo around the tall buildings. Other than that though I like the stars created by the lights. And I like the fact that the water is a major subject. Well done.', '2011-10-20 19:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572704, 979068, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like the top half of this shot. The bottom on the other hand Seems a bit soft. A little bit of sharpening would have made this shot a ton better than it already is. That mountain is awesome for sure though!</td>', 'I like the top half of this shot. The bottom on the other hand Seems a bit soft. A little bit of sharpening would have made this shot a ton better than it already is. That mountain is awesome for sure though!', '2011-10-20 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572706, 978953, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like it but then again I wish I would have seen more water. To me the water isn''t a major subject in this. I wish you were closer to the water or would have shown more of it. The colors are great and you picked a good day with a dramatic sky. Well done.</td>', 'I like it but then again I wish I would have seen more water. To me the water isn''t a major subject in this. I wish you were closer to the water or would have shown more of it. The colors are great and you picked a good day with a dramatic sky. Well done.', '2011-10-20 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572724, 979111, 25787, '<td valign="top">Great composition and wonderful pose from the birds. Could be a tad sharper, and the water between the logs seems unnaturally bright. Did you do some dodging there. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Great composition and wonderful pose from the birds. Could be a tad sharper, and the water between the logs seems unnaturally bright. Did you do some dodging there. Very nice photo.', '2011-10-20 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572727, 979109, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and good water blur, but the composition is weak. Need something in the photo to give it more interest. Even a rock in the foreground would help.</td>', 'Nice scene and good water blur, but the composition is weak. Need something in the photo to give it more interest. Even a rock in the foreground would help.', '2011-10-20 20:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572728, 979113, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the bridge.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the bridge.', '2011-10-20 20:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572729, 978967, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and silky water. Very Nice!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and silky water. Very Nice!', '2011-10-20 20:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572730, 979135, 25787, '<td valign="top">That''s one beautiful sky.</td>', 'That''s one beautiful sky.', '2011-10-20 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572732, 979168, 25787, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2011-10-20 20:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572734, 979042, 25787, '<td valign="top">That water is great camouflage for the duck. Good photo.</td>', 'That water is great camouflage for the duck. Good photo.', '2011-10-20 20:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572737, 978993, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, well captured. I''m not sure I love the row of grass on the near side of the pond. Maybe more or less of it would be better.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, well captured. I''m not sure I love the row of grass on the near side of the pond. Maybe more or less of it would be better.', '2011-10-20 20:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572745, 979024, 25787, '<td valign="top">Love the color the sunset gives the swan.</td>', 'Love the color the sunset gives the swan.', '2011-10-20 20:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572750, 978980, 25787, '<td valign="top">Different, but I like it.</td>', 'Different, but I like it.', '2011-10-20 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572831, 978468, 30669, '<td valign="top">Love this.    10</td>', 'Love this.    10', '2011-10-20 23:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572834, 979064, 30669, '<td valign="top">South Haven?</td>', 'South Haven?', '2011-10-20 23:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6572877, 978993, 96664, '<td valign="top">There are a few things I want to say about this. One - I love the sunrise(set). Awesome colors. Two - I like the reflection! Three - I am not sure I like the left set of trees. They seem like you might have done a bit of selective brightening and it sort of came out flat in color. And lastly number four - I think you could have gotten away without the bottom layer of grass. Either that or added more of it. Either way would have worked. :)</td>', 'There are a few things I want to say about this. One - I love the sunrise(set). Awesome colors. Two - I like the reflection! Three - I am not sure I like the left set of trees. They seem like you might have done a bit of selective brightening and it sort of came out flat in color. And lastly number four - I think you could have gotten away without the bottom layer of grass. Either that or added more of it. Either way would have worked. :)', '2011-10-21 00:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573213, 979148, 100831, '<td valign="top">they sparkle!</td>', 'they sparkle!', '2011-10-21 09:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573215, 979042, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice squiggles:)</td>', 'Nice squiggles:)', '2011-10-21 09:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573219, 978789, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is just gorgeous - all the rich tones and beautiful textures covered just right by the waves and spray. And I love the hint of the world beyond. Quite excellent.</td>', 'This is just gorgeous - all the rich tones and beautiful textures covered just right by the waves and spray. And I love the hint of the world beyond. Quite excellent.', '2011-10-21 09:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573221, 978601, 100831, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Love the fog. And your composition emphasizes the expanse of sea.</td>', 'Awesome. Love the fog. And your composition emphasizes the expanse of sea.', '2011-10-21 09:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573223, 978837, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the golden tones, the wide view and reflection.</td>', 'I love the golden tones, the wide view and reflection.', '2011-10-21 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573224, 979078, 100831, '<td valign="top">lovely... the textures and colors and reflection are very well done.</td>', 'lovely... the textures and colors and reflection are very well done.', '2011-10-21 10:00:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6573285, 979048, 96574, '<td valign="top">interesting angle to make a relatively small wave look gigantic.<br/>nice colors and the red wetsuit makes the surfer pop.</td>', 'interesting angle to make a relatively small wave look gigantic.nice colors and the red wetsuit makes the surfer pop.', '2011-10-21 10:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573547, 978910, 113591, '<td valign="top">Really, really beautiful. Go team.  Not voting</td>', 'Really, really beautiful. Go team.  Not voting', '2011-10-21 17:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573550, 979193, 113591, '<td valign="top">Lava</td>', 'Lava', '2011-10-21 17:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573553, 978990, 113591, '<td valign="top">The colours do catch one''s eye. Well done, teammate. Not voting</td>', 'The colours do catch one''s eye. Well done, teammate. Not voting', '2011-10-21 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573571, 979024, 117804, '<td valign="top">A bit cluttered but so serene...</td>', 'A bit cluttered but so serene...', '2011-10-21 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573572, 978631, 117804, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different crop would have added to that one</td>', 'Maybe a different crop would have added to that one', '2011-10-21 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573573, 978407, 117804, '<td valign="top">a bit unreal but so nice...</td>', 'a bit unreal but so nice...', '2011-10-21 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573575, 979144, 117804, '<td valign="top">It is somehow flat. The clouds could have make it a very good one...</td>', 'It is somehow flat. The clouds could have make it a very good one...', '2011-10-21 17:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573578, 978969, 136989, '<td valign="top">Highlights are a bit too much but pretty still.</td>', 'Highlights are a bit too much but pretty still.', '2011-10-21 17:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573579, 978915, 117804, '<td valign="top">Really like the idea...</td>', 'Really like the idea...', '2011-10-21 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573580, 978953, 136989, '<td valign="top">Terrific sky and autumn colors.  For me the green shrubs up front are too tall and take away impact from the far shore.</td>', 'Terrific sky and autumn colors.  For me the green shrubs up front are too tall and take away impact from the far shore.', '2011-10-21 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573581, 978433, 136989, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the pink border. The intensity of the photo can speak for itself.</td>', 'Not a fan of the pink border. The intensity of the photo can speak for itself.', '2011-10-21 17:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573582, 979108, 136989, '<td valign="top">Like it. Wonder how it would have come out with a portrait orientation and more real estate above the horse to get it away from the edge.</td>', 'Like it. Wonder how it would have come out with a portrait orientation and more real estate above the horse to get it away from the edge.', '2011-10-21 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573623, 979068, 131419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours love the play of the sunlight</td>', 'Beautiful colours love the play of the sunlight', '2011-10-21 19:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573624, 979042, 131419, '<td valign="top">This is really different, the colours seem to change the velocity of the water.  Great affect</td>', 'This is really different, the colours seem to change the velocity of the water.  Great affect', '2011-10-21 19:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573627, 979114, 131419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the depth of the colours are amazing</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the depth of the colours are amazing', '2011-10-21 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573773, 979056, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the panoramic look, but the black bars are just a bit much for me.  I bet this would look good really, really big.</td>', 'I like the panoramic look, but the black bars are just a bit much for me.  I bet this would look good really, really big.', '2011-10-22 00:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573775, 978789, 42495, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I can see this being on the front page at rollover.</td>', 'Love it.  I can see this being on the front page at rollover.', '2011-10-22 00:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573778, 978433, 42495, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful photo but that frame just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Such a beautiful photo but that frame just doesn''t work for me.', '2011-10-22 00:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573859, 978601, 96664, '<td valign="top">I love the mist! And that boat looks awesome! I wonder what would happen is you drop that horizon line to the lower third? Hmm...</td>', 'I love the mist! And that boat looks awesome! I wonder what would happen is you drop that horizon line to the lower third? Hmm...', '2011-10-22 09:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573860, 978924, 96664, '<td valign="top">This is great! I like the colors. What is that in the water? (little black spec in the left third about an inch below the bridge, a bird perhaps? Cloning that out might have helped).</td>', 'This is great! I like the colors. What is that in the water? (little black spec in the left third about an inch below the bridge, a bird perhaps? Cloning that out might have helped).', '2011-10-22 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573864, 978854, 96664, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that this will bomb... Not entirely sure how to fix it though. I think that this type of shot never has a "wow" factor to it which is unfortunate because they are almost as good as a self portrait!</td>', 'I have a feeling that this will bomb... Not entirely sure how to fix it though. I think that this type of shot never has a "wow" factor to it which is unfortunate because they are almost as good as a self portrait!', '2011-10-22 09:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573866, 979085, 96664, '<td valign="top">Although is seems like low quality, I like the shot as a whole. The reflections on the water is what I like most. :)</td>', 'Although is seems like low quality, I like the shot as a whole. The reflections on the water is what I like most. :)', '2011-10-22 09:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573868, 979024, 96664, '<td valign="top">This is really nice but I fear it won''t do well because the colors (mainly on the tree) seem a bit flat. I think either bringing the colors out a lot with HDR or having the tree silhouetted.</td>', 'This is really nice but I fear it won''t do well because the colors (mainly on the tree) seem a bit flat. I think either bringing the colors out a lot with HDR or having the tree silhouetted.', '2011-10-22 09:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573869, 979162, 96664, '<td valign="top">Clean photo but I fear that it won''t do well because it has no "wow" factor. I do however like that you have all three ares covered (foreground middle and background).</td>', 'Clean photo but I fear that it won''t do well because it has no "wow" factor. I do however like that you have all three ares covered (foreground middle and background).', '2011-10-22 09:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6573870, 979045, 96664, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot! I attempted to do something like this for my entry but was unsuccessful with my attempt. This pier looks awesome too. Well done! One thing that sort of bothers me though is that I wish that you were a bit closer to the first set of pylons. (sort of a risk factor with the water near your camera though so I would understand you not getting out there any deeper).</td>', 'I really like this shot! I attempted to do something like this for my entry but was unsuccessful with my attempt. This pier looks awesome too. Well done! One thing that sort of bothers me though is that I wish that you were a bit closer to the first set of pylons. (sort of a risk factor with the water near your camera though so I would understand you not getting out there any deeper).', '2011-10-22 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574008, 978407, 42013, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge. I like the lowcontrast treatment in the foreground that shows just enough light and texture.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge. I like the lowcontrast treatment in the foreground that shows just enough light and texture.', '2011-10-22 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574009, 978959, 42013, '<td valign="top">The pastel colors are great and the two ducks flying away give the scene a nice break from the stationary.</td>', 'The pastel colors are great and the two ducks flying away give the scene a nice break from the stationary.', '2011-10-22 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574018, 978813, 136392, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2011-10-22 14:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574032, 978601, 101702, '<td valign="top">The ship, bridge, mist combination look great, but I think I would have cropped some of the water out (I know the water was the subject). A crop from the left and bottom bringing the horizon lower in the shot with a bit more headroom for the top of the bridge would have been perfect.</td>', 'The ship, bridge, mist combination look great, but I think I would have cropped some of the water out (I know the water was the subject). A crop from the left and bottom bringing the horizon lower in the shot with a bit more headroom for the top of the bridge would have been perfect.', '2011-10-22 14:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574036, 978401, 101702, '<td valign="top">A tad picky but I would have cropped a tiny bit from the bottom to remove the grass overlapping the water. I feel that would just help the eye flow along the water, but at the moment that clump of grass breaks the flow. Nice range of tones and saturation though.</td>', 'A tad picky but I would have cropped a tiny bit from the bottom to remove the grass overlapping the water. I feel that would just help the eye flow along the water, but at the moment that clump of grass breaks the flow. Nice range of tones and saturation though.', '2011-10-22 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574041, 979146, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great definition in the clouds and nice reflections. Personally I find the dissected tree on the left slightly distracting and would either have tried to bulk it out in the original shot, or crop it out.</td>', 'Great definition in the clouds and nice reflections. Personally I find the dissected tree on the left slightly distracting and would either have tried to bulk it out in the original shot, or crop it out.', '2011-10-22 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574043, 979173, 101702, '<td valign="top">Soft and dreamy image. Almost looks like a painting.</td>', 'Soft and dreamy image. Almost looks like a painting.', '2011-10-22 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574047, 978856, 101702, '<td valign="top">Note quite sure what the thing at the bottom is (a jetty?) - I would have preferred to see a bit more of it to give it some context or crop it out completely as where it is at the moment is neither here nor there and a little distracting. Great definition in the sky though which helps life the image.</td>', 'Note quite sure what the thing at the bottom is (a jetty?) - I would have preferred to see a bit more of it to give it some context or crop it out completely as where it is at the moment is neither here nor there and a little distracting. Great definition in the sky though which helps life the image.', '2011-10-22 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574049, 978980, 136392, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot!</td>', 'Nice Shot!', '2011-10-22 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574050, 979042, 136392, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the ripples in the water!</td>', 'Nice, love the ripples in the water!', '2011-10-22 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574051, 979078, 136392, '<td valign="top">Really like the details of the rocks!</td>', 'Really like the details of the rocks!', '2011-10-22 15:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574052, 978801, 101702, '<td valign="top">The sloping horizon is a real shame in this shot, it''s just one thing I can never overlook as it makes me feel wonky. Other than that, the mood is great.</td>', 'The sloping horizon is a real shame in this shot, it''s just one thing I can never overlook as it makes me feel wonky. Other than that, the mood is great.', '2011-10-22 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574054, 978837, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice mood to this shot, but lacks a little clarity. Also, is that a big dust spot top right? You could clone that out within the rules.</td>', 'Nice mood to this shot, but lacks a little clarity. Also, is that a big dust spot top right? You could clone that out within the rules.', '2011-10-22 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574056, 978433, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and palette, but I really find the border distracts. The colours are fine for the border but the dimensions are over-powering. A fine pink line with a black outer about a third of the current thickness would give more balance. As it is, the border seems to equate for at least 25% of the image area, which is a shame as it''s such a strong image.</td>', 'Nice scene and palette, but I really find the border distracts. The colours are fine for the border but the dimensions are over-powering. A fine pink line with a black outer about a third of the current thickness would give more balance. As it is, the border seems to equate for at least 25% of the image area, which is a shame as it''s such a strong image.', '2011-10-22 15:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574059, 978434, 101702, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, shame about the lack of sharpness on the front rocks. Did you focus at the hyperfocal distance?</td>', 'Lovely image, shame about the lack of sharpness on the front rocks. Did you focus at the hyperfocal distance?', '2011-10-22 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574083, 979068, 101702, '<td valign="top">Slightly sloping horizon distracts slightly from an otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Slightly sloping horizon distracts slightly from an otherwise great shot.', '2011-10-22 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574090, 978910, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint... looks more like a dragon''s eye to me though :-)</td>', 'Great viewpoint... looks more like a dragon''s eye to me though :-)', '2011-10-22 16:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574093, 978840, 101702, '<td valign="top">Front page without a doubt. The negative thing I can see is what seems to be a slightly wonky horizon which I always personally find distracting. Other than that, a near perfect image.</td>', 'Front page without a doubt. The negative thing I can see is what seems to be a slightly wonky horizon which I always personally find distracting. Other than that, a near perfect image.', '2011-10-22 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574094, 978801, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot, but the obvious tilt would have been a very easy fix.</td>', 'Nice moody shot, but the obvious tilt would have been a very easy fix.', '2011-10-22 17:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574095, 979112, 101702, '<td valign="top">Front page for sure. I love the way that the long exposure has not only blurred the water but the clouds as well. Great colour palette and balance to the image. The only negative I see is the object to the lower left, and I wonder whether it would be legal in advanced to clone that out with some water - but I guess the lighting reflections would make that tricky. I would still expect a ribbon for this though :-)</td>', 'Front page for sure. I love the way that the long exposure has not only blurred the water but the clouds as well. Great colour palette and balance to the image. The only negative I see is the object to the lower left, and I wonder whether it would be legal in advanced to clone that out with some water - but I guess the lighting reflections would make that tricky. I would still expect a ribbon for this though :-)', '2011-10-22 17:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574186, 979160, 11769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition</td>', 'Beautiful composition', '2011-10-22 21:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574187, 979187, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like a dream of a sky.</td>', 'Like a dream of a sky.', '2011-10-22 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574188, 979148, 11769, '<td valign="top">Slowly drifting away.</td>', 'Slowly drifting away.', '2011-10-22 21:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574230, 979187, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hudson river, perhaps?</td>', 'Hudson river, perhaps?', '2011-10-23 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574231, 979166, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully minimalist. This image screams <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a> to me.</td>', 'Wonderfully minimalist. This image screams  bspurgeon to me.', '2011-10-23 00:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574306, 979167, 19825, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and simple composition</td>', 'Love the colors and simple composition', '2011-10-23 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574361, 979035, 117804, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on the water. Would have like to see the bird more..</td>', 'Nice colors on the water. Would have like to see the bird more..', '2011-10-23 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574363, 979034, 117804, '<td valign="top">nice idea maybe with a tad more light it could have been yet better</td>', 'nice idea maybe with a tad more light it could have been yet better', '2011-10-23 12:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574364, 978686, 117804, '<td valign="top">Really like the colors on the birds</td>', 'Really like the colors on the birds', '2011-10-23 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574365, 979047, 117804, '<td valign="top">Nice moon</td>', 'Nice moon', '2011-10-23 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574366, 978813, 117804, '<td valign="top">nice, would have love to see the scene with a diffrent cropping</td>', 'nice, would have love to see the scene with a diffrent cropping', '2011-10-23 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574367, 979061, 117804, '<td valign="top">stunning place</td>', 'stunning place', '2011-10-23 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574368, 979193, 117804, '<td valign="top">Impressionnant, presque hypnotique :-)</td>', 'Impressionnant, presque hypnotique :-)', '2011-10-23 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574375, 979069, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovely image,just a bit too dark on right and bottom on my screen.</td>', 'Lovely image,just a bit too dark on right and bottom on my screen.', '2011-10-23 13:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574376, 979135, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.</td>', 'Very nice work.', '2011-10-23 13:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574377, 978802, 118154, '<td valign="top">Jumps out of the screen at me.</td>', 'Jumps out of the screen at me.', '2011-10-23 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6574378, 978601, 118154, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stuff.', '2011-10-23 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
