(6574500, 978854, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing by the location given in the title, that this may be an entry from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59562" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Gaurav</a>. I''m afraid I''m going to have to give this one a fairly low vote, sorry. There''s not a lot of interest in this shot, and photographing one''s own shadow is fairly cliche, imo. I''ve done it myself, of course and never thought much of those shots. The rocks in the shallow water do have some nice texture, but the whole thing comes off a bit flat looking to me. I think some of the right adjustments could bring that out and give it a little more visual oomph. I would love to see some of the rest of the great scenery that I know you have in Nepal.</td>', 'I''m guessing by the location given in the title, that this may be an entry from  Gaurav. I''m afraid I''m going to have to give this one a fairly low vote, sorry. There''s not a lot of interest in this shot, and photographing one''s own shadow is fairly cliche, imo. I''ve done it myself, of course and never thought much of those shots. The rocks in the shallow water do have some nice texture, but the whole thing comes off a bit flat looking to me. I think some of the right adjustments could bring that out and give it a little more visual oomph. I would love to see some of the rest of the great scenery that I know you have in Nepal.', '2011-10-23 19:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
