(6575400, 979048, 38127, '<td valign="top">I knew this was yours even before I saw the name ;) Gorgeous as always. <br/>Are you in the water with flippers and water housing now???  Hope you are shopping some of these images to the surf magazine community :)</td>', 'I knew this was yours even before I saw the name ;) Gorgeous as always. Are you in the water with flippers and water housing now???  Hope you are shopping some of these images to the surf magazine community :)', '2011-10-24 17:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6575427, 978601, 1031, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!!<br/> <br/>Really like how the mist at the waterline gives it a very ghostly look, appropriate for the subject IMO. I''d be curious to see this in grayscale, without the bright blue bit of sky ... perhaps even darkening it --  moving in the direction of the noir look. With a vertical crop I can see it as a WW II movie poster ...</td>', 'Congratulations!!! Really like how the mist at the waterline gives it a very ghostly look, appropriate for the subject IMO. I''d be curious to see this in grayscale, without the bright blue bit of sky ... perhaps even darkening it --  moving in the direction of the noir look. With a vertical crop I can see it as a WW II movie poster ...', '2011-10-24 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 0),
